    "body": "## Summary\n- pin the Trivy GitHub Action used by production image scanning to the exact immutable commit SHA that backed the already-green v0.36.0 runs\n- add a repository guard that scans every workflow `uses:` reference\n- allow local actions and GitHub-owned `actions/*` / `github/*` major-version refs\n- require every other external action to use a full 40-character commit SHA\n- add a dedicated workflow supply-chain contract that runs whenever workflow definitions or the guard change\n\n## Why\nA mutable third-party tag can be retargeted upstream after review. The existing Trivy action was the only third-party action in the workflow inventory, so pinning it plus enforcing the rule prevents that class of supply-chain drift from returning.\n\n## Merge gate\nMerge only when the exact PR head has a green supply-chain contract, container-security scan, CodeQL and normal CI; master must remain unchanged and the branch must be 0 commits behind.",
